king.</p></div></li><li role="none" class="group/l2 w-full"><a class="block text-lg whitespace-nowrap text-white outline-none hover:underline focus:ring-2 focus:ring-white md:text-sm lg:w-max 2xl:text-2xl" href="/about-us/leadership">Leadership</a><div aria-hidden="true" class="absolute top-0 right-[-100%] hidden w-70 flex-col transition-opacity duration-300 lg:flex pointer-events-none opacity-0" style="left:calc(100% + 3rem);top:0"><div class="relative mb-4 overflow-hidden rounded-lg"><img alt="" width="400" height="400" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="h-auto w-full object-cover" style="color:transparent" srcSet="https://images.ctfassets.net/bjl3f17nyta4/6BZeCG5aMU702OjhbjhW5m/4377c13a8ab709d7883845806de0ec6a/Who-we-are_0002s_0002_Leadership.png?w=400&amp;q=85&amp;fm=webp 1x, https://images.ctfassets.net/bjl3f17nyta4/6BZeCG5aMU702OjhbjhW5m/4377c13a8ab709d7883845806de0ec6a/Who-we-are_0002s_0002_Leadership.png?w=900&amp;q=85&amp;fm=webp 2x" src="https://images.ctfassets.net/bjl3f17nyta4/6BZeCG5aMU702OjhbjhW5m/4377c13a8ab709d7883845806de0ec6a/Who-we-are_0002s_0002_Leadership.png?w=900&amp;q=85&amp;fm=webp"/></div><p class="mb-4 text-base font-extralight text-white lg:text-lg">Meet the minds shaping our strategy and pushing boundaries to unlock growth, innovation, and impact.</p></div></li><li role="none" class="group/l2 w-full"><a class="block text-lg whitespace-nowrap text-white outline-none hover:underline focus:ring-2 focus:ring-white md:text-sm lg:w-max 2xl:text-2xl" href="/about-us/our-brand">Our Brand</a><div aria-hidden="true" class="absolute top-0 right-[-100%] hidden w-70 flex-col transition-opacity duration-300 lg:flex pointer-events-none opacity-0" style="left:calc(100% + 3rem);top:0"><div class="relative mb-4 overflow-hidden rounded-lg"><img alt="" width="400" height="400" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="h-auto w-full object-cover" style="color:transparent" srcSet="https://images.ctfassets.net/bjl3f17nyta4/4jlsjxL0tqbE5wrhw4vkgZ/8dbf0b1273b477940a895e3e88b5c3de/brand.png?w=400&amp;q=85&amp;fm=webp 1x, https://images.ctfassets.net/bjl3f17nyta4/4jlsjxL0tqbE5wrhw4vkgZ/8dbf0b1273b477940a895e3e88b5c3de/brand.png?w=900&amp;q=85&amp;fm=webp 2x" src="https://images.ctfassets.net/bjl3f17nyta4/4jlsjxL0tqbE5wrhw4vkgZ/8dbf0b1273b477940a895e3e88b5c3de/brand.png?w=900&amp;q=85&amp;fm=webp"/></div><p class="mb-4 text-base font-extralight text-white lg:text-lg">Built on ‘Experience-led Everything,’ our brand stands for solutions that are human-first, outcome-driven, and designed for real-world impact.</p></div></li><li role="none" class="group/l2 w-full"><a class="block text-lg whitespace-nowrap text-white outline-none hover:underline focus:ring-2 focus:ring-white md:text-sm lg:w-max 2xl:text-2xl" href="/zenlabs">Our Innovation - Zenlabs</a><div aria-hidden="true" class="absolute top-0 right-[-100%] hidden w-70 flex-col transition-opacity duration-300 lg:flex pointer-events-none opacity-0" style="left:calc(100% + 3rem);top:0"><div class="relative mb-4 overflow-hidden rounded-lg"><img alt="" width="400" height="400" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="h-auto w-full object-cover" style="color:transparent" srcSet="https://images.ctfassets.net/bjl3f17nyta4/5alYDdfZmVgdUbC90Frc8L/abeb51baa108c761b4d9489407835090/Zenlabs_Mobile_800x800.jpg?w=400&amp;q=85&amp;fm=webp 1x, https://images.ctfassets.net/bjl3f17nyta4/5alYDdfZmVgdUbC90Frc8L/abeb51baa108c761b4d9489407835090/Zenlabs_Mobile_800x800.jpg?w=900&amp;q=85&amp;fm=webp 2x" src="https://images.ctfassets.net/bjl3f17nyta4/5alYDdfZmVgdUbC90Frc8L/abeb51baa108c761b4d9489407835090/Zenlabs_Mobile_800x800.jpg?w=900&amp;q=85&amp;fm=webp"/></div><p class="mb-4 text-base font-extralight text-white lg:text-lg">Zenlabs, Zensar’s innovation hub, drives AI, GenAI, Cloud, NVIDIA tech, and IoT R&amp;D. It incubates CoEs, co-innovates with clients from ideation to prototype, files patents, and delivers solutions for BFSI, retail, and healthcare.</p></div></li><li role="none" class="group/l2 w-full"><a class="block text-lg whitespace-nowrap text-white outline-none hover:underline focus:ring-2 focus:ring-white md:text-sm lg:w-max 2xl:text-2xl" href="/about-us/awards-and-recognitions">Awards and Recognition</a><div aria-hidden="true" class="absolute top-0 right-[-100%] hidden w-70 flex-col transition-opacity duration-300 lg:flex pointer-events-none opacity-0" style="left:calc(100% + 3rem);top:0"><div class="relative mb-4 overflow-hidden rounded-lg"><img alt="" width="400" height="400" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="h-auto w-full object-cover" style="color:transparent" srcSet="https://images.ctfassets.net/bjl3f17nyta4/71VBhym1sHq41bLUmdBt8L/b5636afc612528acd68d27a002a3bb4a/awards.png?w=400&amp;q=85&amp;fm=webp 1x, https://images.ctfassets.net/bjl3f17nyta4/71VBhym1sHq41bLUmdBt8L/b5636afc612528acd68d27a002a3bb4a/awards.png?w=900&amp;q=85&amp;fm=webp 2x" src="https://images.ctfassets.net/bjl3f17nyta4/71VBhym1sHq41bLUmdBt8L/b5636afc612528acd68d27a002a3bb4a/awards.png?w=900&amp;q=85&amp;fm=webp"/></div><p class="mb-4 text-base font-extralight text-white lg:text-lg">From innovation to excellence, see how our work has been recognized by global analysts, partners, and industry leaders.</p></div></li><li role="none" class="group/l2 w-full"><a class="block text-lg whitespace-nowrap text-white outline-none hover:underline focus:ring-2 focus:ring-white md:text-sm lg:w-max 2xl:text-2xl" href="/about-us/sustainability">Sustainability</a><div aria-hidden="true" class="absolute top-0 right-[-100%] hidden w-70 flex-col transition-opacity duration-300 lg:flex pointer-events-none opacity-0" style="left:calc(100% + 3rem);top:0"><div class="relative mb-4 overflow-hidden rounded-lg"><img alt="" width="400" height="400" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="h-auto w-full object-cover" style="color:transparent" srcSet="https://images.ctfassets.net/bjl3f17nyta4/7y7u2xENlB7RMbX1WHgkkb/d76d98ed17c0912c6af08d5b54d6963e/Sustainability.png?w=400&amp;q=85&amp;fm=webp 1x, https://images.ctfassets.net/bjl3f17nyta4/7y7u2xENlB7RMbX1WHgkkb/d76d98ed17c0912c6af08d5b54d6963e/Sustainability.png?w=900&amp;q=85&amp;fm=webp 2x" src="https://images.ctfassets.net/bjl3f17nyta4/7y7u2xENlB7RMbX1WHgkkb/d76d98ed17c0912c6af08d5b54d6963e/Sustainability.png?w=900&amp;q=85&amp;fm=webp"/></div><p class="mb-4 text-base font-extralight text-white lg:text-lg">From design to delivery, we&#x27;re committed to solutions that care for the business, communities, and the environment.</p></div></li><li role="none" class="group/l2 w-full"><a class="block text-lg whitespace-nowrap text-white outline-none hover:underline focus:ring-2 focus:ring-white md:text-sm lg:w-max 2xl:text-2xl" href="/about-us/corporate-social-responsibility">CSR</a><div aria-hidden="true" class="absolute top-0 right-[-100%] hidden w-70 flex-col transition-opacity duration-300 lg:flex pointer-events-none opacity-0" style="left:calc(100% + 3rem);top:0"><div class="relative mb-4 overflow-hidden rounded-lg"><img alt="" width="400" height="400" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="h-auto w-full object-cover" style="color:transparent" srcSet="https://images.ctfassets.net/bjl3f17nyta4/3XY1xKIbmanqwVmkqu9gwZ/1bd50b123f9ceaaba25a34379b7e31bb/CSR-1.jpg?w=400&amp;q=85&amp;fm=webp 1x, https://images.ctfassets.net/bjl3f17nyta4/3XY1xKIbmanqwVmkqu9gwZ/1bd50b123f9ceaaba25a34379b7e31bb/CSR-1.jpg?w=900&amp;q=85&amp;fm=webp 2x" src="https://images.ctfassets.net/bjl3f17nyta4/3XY1xKIbmanqwVmkqu9gwZ/1bd50b123f9ceaaba25a34379b7e31bb/CSR-1.jpg?w=900&amp;q=85&amp;fm=webp"/></div><p class="mb-4 text-base font-extralight text-white lg:text-lg">We use the power of technology, compassion, and community to build more inclusive, equitable, and empowered futures. </p></div></li><li role="none" class="group/l2 w-full"><a class="block text-lg whitespace-nowrap text-white outline-none hover:underline focus:ring-2 focus:ring-white md:text-sm lg:w-max 2xl:text-2xl" href="/partners">Partners</a><div aria-hidden="true" class="absolute top-0 right-[-100%] hidden w-70 flex-col transition-opacity duration-300 lg:flex pointer-events-none opacity-0" style="left:calc(100% + 3rem);top:0"><div class="relative mb-4 overflow-hidden rounded-lg"><img alt="" width="400" height="400" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="h-auto w-full object-cover" style="color:transparent" srcSet="https://images.ctfassets.net/bjl3f17nyta4/3kEdevECN4ky6OwQO3YZyL/efc32dfb200ea89f09f41cadfa0f87b7/Partners-Page.png?w=400&amp;q=85&amp;fm=webp 1x, https://images.ctfassets.net/bjl3f17nyta4/3kEdevECN4ky6OwQO3YZyL/efc32dfb200ea89f09f41cadfa0f87b7/Partners-Page.png?w=900&amp;q=85&amp;fm=webp 2x" src="https://images.ctfassets.net/bjl3f17nyta4/3kEdevECN4ky6OwQO3YZyL/efc32dfb200ea89f09f41cadfa0f87b7/Partners-Page.png?w=900&amp;q=85&amp;fm=webp"/></div><p class="mb-4 text-base font-extralight text-white lg:text-lg">Strategic collaborations power better outcomes. Together with our partners, we help clients unlock efficiency, scale smarter, and stay ahead.</p></div></li><li role="none" class="group/l2 w-full"><a class="block text-lg whitespace-nowrap text-white outline-none hover:underline focus:ring-2 focus:ring-white md:text-sm lg:w-max 2xl:text-2xl" href="/newsroom">PR and News</a><div aria-hidden="true" class="absolute top-0 right-[-100%] hidden w-70 flex-col transition-opacity duration-300 lg:flex pointer-events-none opacity-0" style="left:calc(100% + 3rem);top:0"><div class="relative mb-4 overflow-hidden rounded-lg"><img alt="" width="400" height="400" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="h-auto w-full object-cover" style="color:transparent" srcSet="https://images.ctfassets.net/bjl3f17nyta4/7yMHuBb3MOOF8qGnjrmdRF/1f6cde7413489f528c896685f0ca2443/PR.png?w=400&amp;q=85&amp;fm=webp 1x, https://images.ctfassets.net/bjl3f17nyta4/7yMHuBb3MOOF8qGnjrmdRF/1f6cde7413489f528c896685f0ca2443/PR.png?w=900&amp;q=85&amp;fm=webp 2x" src="https://images.ctfassets.net/bjl3f17nyta4/7yMHuBb3MOOF8qGnjrmdRF/1f6cde7413489f528c896685f0ca2443/PR.png?w=900&amp;q=85&amp;fm=webp"/></div><p class="mb-4 text-base font-extralight text-white lg:text-lg">Catch up on the latest stories - from press releases to media resources - straight from our newsroom.</p></div></li><li role="none" class="group/l2 w-full"><a class="block text-lg whitespace-nowrap text-white outline-none hover:underline focus:ring-2 focus:ring-white md:text-sm lg:w-max 2xl:text-2xl" href="/events-and-webinars">Events and Webinars</a><div aria-hidden="true" class="absolute top-0 right-[-100%] hidden w-70 flex-col transition-opacity duration-300 lg:flex pointer-events-none opacity-0" style="left:calc(100% + 3rem);top:0"><div class="relative mb-4 overflow-hidden rounded-lg"><img alt="" width="400" height="400" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="h-auto w-full object-cover" style="color:transparent" srcSet="https://images.ctfassets.net/bjl3f17nyta4/3E6igPHgGTlduZ2QO5Cxuu/4dca60dd37c52c950b6486f00eed341b/Event-and-webinats.png?w=400&amp;q=85&amp;fm=webp 1x, https://images.ctfassets.net/bjl3f17nyta4/3E6igPHgGTlduZ2QO5Cxuu/4dca60dd37c52c950b6486f00eed341b/Event-and-webinats.png?w=900&amp;q=85&amp;fm=webp 2x" src="https://images.ctfassets.net/bjl3f17nyta4/3E6igPHgGTlduZ2QO5Cxuu/4dca60dd37c52c950b6486f00eed341b/Event-and-webinats.png?w=900&amp;q=85&amp;fm=webp"/></div><p class="mb-4 text-base font-extralight text-white lg:text-lg">Stay in the know with upcoming events and webinars. Learn from experts, discover cutting-edge technologies, and explore what’s next.</p></div></li></ul></div></div></div></nav></li><li role="none" class="flex w-full cursor-pointer justify-between text-lg transition-opacity md:text-sm 2xl:text-2xl"><button role="menuitem" aria-haspopup="true" aria-expanded="false" class="flex w-full items-center justify-between text-left text-lg transition-colors outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-white focus-visible:text-white md:text-sm 2xl:text-2xl text-[#BFBFB2] hover:text-white">For Our Investors<svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" 