y shapes our financial story.</p></div></li><li role="none" class="group/l2 w-full"><a class="block text-lg whitespace-nowrap text-white outline-none hover:underline focus:ring-2 focus:ring-white md:text-sm lg:w-max 2xl:text-2xl" href="/investors/shareholders-information">Shareholder&#x27;s Information</a><div aria-hidden="true" class="absolute top-0 right-[-100%] hidden w-70 flex-col transition-opacity duration-300 lg:flex pointer-events-none opacity-0" style="left:calc(100% + 3rem);top:0"><div class="relative mb-4 overflow-hidden rounded-lg"><img alt="" width="400" height="400" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="h-auto w-full object-cover" style="color:transparent" srcSet="https://images.ctfassets.net/bjl3f17nyta4/7fCy8IO43QMKe7Xoui3anf/dba2d53d2c07e84b86683fd5a708057f/Investors_0001s_0002_shareholdersinformation.png?w=400&amp;q=85&amp;fm=webp 1x, https://images.ctfassets.net/bjl3f17nyta4/7fCy8IO43QMKe7Xoui3anf/dba2d53d2c07e84b86683fd5a708057f/Investors_0001s_0002_shareholdersinformation.png?w=900&amp;q=85&amp;fm=webp 2x" src="https://images.ctfassets.net/bjl3f17nyta4/7fCy8IO43QMKe7Xoui3anf/dba2d53d2c07e84b86683fd5a708057f/Investors_0001s_0002_shareholdersinformation.png?w=900&amp;q=85&amp;fm=webp"/></div><p class="mb-4 text-base font-extralight text-white lg:text-lg">Your one-stop source for shareholder updates, statutory notices, and regulatory information. </p></div></li><li role="none" class="group/l2 w-full"><a class="block text-lg whitespace-nowrap text-white outline-none hover:underline focus:ring-2 focus:ring-white md:text-sm lg:w-max 2xl:text-2xl" href="/investors/corporate-governance">Corporate Governance</a><div aria-hidden="true" class="absolute top-0 right-[-100%] hidden w-70 flex-col transition-opacity duration-300 lg:flex pointer-events-none opacity-0" style="left:calc(100% + 3rem);top:0"><div class="relative mb-4 overflow-hidden rounded-lg"><img alt="" width="400" height="400" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="h-auto w-full object-cover" sty